{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Preparing the Proposal", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Will Peter Come Through?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Talking About Habits", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "In the business world, it is important to talk about things that are part of your daily life. <br/><br/>Normally, the <span class=\"strong\">Present Simple tense</span>  is used to describe activities you do on a daily basis. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the following expressions to describe habits. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expression \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Verb form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I (often) tend to ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He <span class=\\\"strong\\\">tends to be</span> on time.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I have a tendency to ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He <span class=\\\"strong\\\">has a tendency to meet</span> deadlines.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I usually ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He <span class=\\\"strong\\\">usually meets</span> his deadlines. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I hardly ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">hardly feel</span> pressured at work.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I (always) make a point of ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" verb - ing \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">always make a point of</span> meet<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ing deadlines. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Leaving a Phone Message", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Talking on the telephone can be challenging for a variety of reasons. Firstly, you are not able to see the person you're talking to, so there's no body language to be read. Secondly, it requires a special set of words, phrases, and expressions. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The chart below will help you to leave a message on the phone confidently in business and personal situations. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Voicemail Message</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello, this is Peter Smith. Sorry to have missed your call.  Please leave your message after the beep.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Leaving a Message</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Hello, _____ (person's name). This is _______ (your name) from _________ (company).\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">1. Introduction</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Hello, _____ (person's name). This is _______ (your name) from _________ (company).\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> 2. Reason for calling</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm calling to let you know that ... (clause)<br/>I'm calling to tell you that ...  (clause)<br/>I'm calling because ... (clause) \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> 3. Request for a call back</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Please give ____ (name) a call when you get this message.<br/>Could you ring me to ... (confirm / discuss / talk about) <br/>Could you give me a call back to ... (verb) \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> 4. Contact information </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You can call / reach / get me on _________ (number). <br/>I'll be in the office until / between / from _________ (time).\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> 5. Ending </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Thank you / Talk later / Bye. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Hello, Mark. This is Mary calling from the HR office. I'm calling because we haven't heard from you. It's 1 pm and we were wondering about the proposal. Please give me a call when you get this message. Thank you!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be put out ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be upset", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter was put out that he had to be in the office yesterday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when talking about habits. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "smug", "type": "name"}, {"content": "looking or feeling too pleased about something you have done or achieved", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He tends to be smug.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "conceited", "type": "name"}, {"content": "thinking you are very clever or skillful", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He tends to be conceited.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "apprehensive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "worried or frightened that something unpleasant may happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm apprehensive with so much depending on the deadline.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "relieved", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling happy because you are no longer worried about something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm relieved that he called!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Create a short answering machine voice message to use when your partner calls you. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think about a problem you are having in the office (for example, your co-worker did not write an e-mail you asked him/her to).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Create a short voice message to send to him/her.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make sure your message includes an introduction, a reason for calling, a request for call back, your contact information, and an ending. If possible, describe the situation using an expression to describe a habit. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u201cCall\u201d your partner and read your voice message to him/her. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are finished, switch roles.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I think of a possible problem in the office. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a short and detailed voice message including an introduction, reason for calling, request for a call back, my contact information, and an ending. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about habits. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le04ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le04ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-120\">Janet</span>: Hi Miranda. Peter's not come in today, has he?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Nope. I'm not surprised. He seemed pretty put out that we were expected to be here yesterday.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: He was certainly smug when the storm did head this way and I announced the office was closing.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Smug! He tends to be conceited.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Ummm, I suppose you'd have told me if you'd received the proposal from him yet. Doesn't he also have a tendency to come through?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: No and yes. No correspondence from him, but yes, he usually does deliver."}, {"image": "engenn7le04ob07re2img06.jpg", "time": "32000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-120\">Janet</span>: Alright, I guess I do know that. I hardly get bothered by things like this but I'll admit I'm more apprehensive now with so much depending on the deadline. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Would you feel more relieved if you spoke to him? I can call him.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Why don't you try?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Answering Machine</span>: Hello, this is Peter Smith. Sorry to have missed your call. Please leave your message after the beep.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Hello, Peter. This is Miranda from the office. We haven't heard from you. Hope you're well despite the storm yesterday. It's 11:30 and we're wondering about the state of the proposal. Please give us a call when you get this message. Thank you."}, {"image": "engenn7le04ob07re2img07.jpg", "time": "83000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-120\">Miranda</span>: I hate answering machines.<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Go have a coffee. I'll call you if there's news. <br/><br/>\n<span class=\"italic\">Twenty-five minutes later ... </span><br/><br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Miranda! There's a fax coming through!<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Peter's proposal! Well, he did make a point of sticking to his word. Five minutes before the deadline - how typical of Peter!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le04ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le04ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about people's habits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can leave a phone message.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about feelings and reactions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How effective are you at work? Do you have any specific habits?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "When was the last time you had to meet a work deadline? Did you make it? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incor